    "name": "Bru & Boegie: Episode 1 - Get da MILK!",
    "steam_appid": 3711090,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slip into the underpants of <strong>Bru</strong>, a caffeine craving man-child on a mission: <strong>get da milk</strong> for his morning coffee! <strong>Point and click</strong> your way through a vibrant hand-drawn 2D world, featuring a <strong>fully human-voiced</strong> cast of animated townsfolk, and a <strong>groovy original soundtrack</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A throwback to the puzzle point-and-click adventure games of yore, <strong><i>Bru and Boegie: EPISODE 1 - Get Da MILK!</i></strong> serves up a STEAMING HOT cup of ridiculousness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711090/extras/df24d9b1ca96d6391d3e403283fa9079.poster.avif?t=1755547807\" width=616 height=126 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711090/extras/df24d9b1ca96d6391d3e403283fa9079.webm?t=1755547807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711090/extras/df24d9b1ca96d6391d3e403283fa9079.mp4?t=1755547807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use revolutionary <strong>Mouse</strong> technology to exert your almighty will on Bru, directing him where to go and what to do! See that shiny interactable object? <strong><i>You can grab it!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711090/extras/f9746d8d83b6d5edc245f86a5336d3f9.poster.avif?t=1755547807\" width=616 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711090/extras/f9746d8d83b6d5edc245f86a5336d3f9.webm?t=1755547807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711090/extras/f9746d8d83b6d5edc245f86a5336d3f9.mp4?t=1755547807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bru</strong> has tighty whitie undies that are not only stylish, but also <i>functional</i>! Store all the items you find in your <strong>PANTSVENTORY\u2122</strong> and use them in the mooniest of moon-logic ways\u00a0to reach your goal of <strong>MILK</strong>.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711090/extras/26eab541219b51e238f7409ef9ab2cb3.poster.avif?t=1755547807\" width=616 height=110 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711090/extras/26eab541219b51e238f7409ef9ab2cb3.webm?t=1755547807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711090/extras/26eab541219b51e238f7409ef9ab2cb3.mp4?t=1755547807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The local townsfolk of <strong>KIFFTOWN</strong> are ready and waiting to exchange ridiculous banter with Bru, or give him a restraining order for <i>VERBAL HARASSMENT</i>. Blurt out <strong>non sequiturs</strong> if you're feeling <i>saucy</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711090/extras/493b62158e46323baadb8f05b74ade0b.poster.avif?t=1755547807\" width=616 height=112 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711090/extras/493b62158e46323baadb8f05b74ade0b.webm?t=1755547807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711090/extras/493b62158e46323baadb8f05b74ade0b.mp4?t=1755547807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Appease the hoarder inside us all! <strong>Collect the stickers</strong> littered around the world to unlock a SUPER SECRET SURPRISE.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You can't die!</strong> Low stress, max lols.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short game -\u00a0</strong>About 45 mins to complete.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mini-Game!</strong>\u00a0Stop the intrusive thoughts from infiltrating your mind in <i>Meditation HERO</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the thrilling first standalone episode in an upcoming trilogy of <i>Bru &amp; Boegie</i> games.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What the People are Saying</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;I have never played a game this funny...&quot; -\u00a0<i>Krizezivota</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;BRILLIANT. Loved every single thing about it.&quot; -\u00a0<i>latetothegames</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Full animation, big fan, a lotta lotta money went into this game - incredible. Epic cutscenes, 10/10 voice acting.&quot; - <i>GrayStillPlays</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;That was officially one of the strangest games I think I've ever played in my life.&quot; -\u00a0<i>GrayStillPlays</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;I honestly f*cking loved every minute of this! So witty and clever, all the little comments about the state of the world as well, just brilliant. Great little character and characters, and the voice acting was on par too! I really hope we get more episodes, like, Get Da Sugaaaa!&quot; -\u00a0<i>VonWeavey</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cAbsolute masterpiece.\u201d - <i>Alene</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;i just finished the game, i just love it, i think this is my new favorite game, or one of them...&quot; -\u00a0<i>dunkkke</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Amazing and unhinged game, I loved it\u201d -\u00a0<i>hyprZona</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cI LOVE THIS\u201d -\u00a0<i>Jaelix</i></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slip into the underpants of <strong>Bru</strong>, a caffeine craving man-child on a mission: <strong>get da milk</strong> for his morning coffee! <strong>Point and click</strong> your way through a vibrant hand-drawn 2D world, featuring a <strong>fully human-voiced</strong> cast of animated townsfolk, and a <strong>groovy original soundtrack</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A throwback to the puzzle point-and-click adventure games of yore, <strong><i>Bru and Boegie: EPISODE 1 - Get Da MILK!</i></strong> serves up a STEAMING HOT cup of ridiculousness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711090/extras/df24d9b1ca96d6391d3e403283fa9079.poster.avif?t=1755547807\" width=616 height=126 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711090/extras/df24d9b1ca96d6391d3e403283fa9079.webm?t=1755547807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711090/extras/df24d9b1ca96d6391d3e403283fa9079.mp4?t=1755547807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use revolutionary <strong>Mouse</strong> technology to exert your almighty will on Bru, directing him where to go and what to do! See that shiny interactable object? <strong><i>You can grab it!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711090/extras/f9746d8d83b6d5edc245f86a5336d3f9.poster.avif?t=1755547807\" width=616 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711090/extras/f9746d8d83b6d5edc245f86a5336d3f9.webm?t=1755547807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711090/extras/f9746d8d83b6d5edc245f86a5336d3f9.mp4?t=1755547807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bru</strong> has tighty whitie undies that are not only stylish, but also <i>functional</i>! Store all the items you find in your <strong>PANTSVENTORY\u2122</strong> and use them in the mooniest of moon-logic ways\u00a0to reach your goal of <strong>MILK</strong>.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711090/extras/26eab541219b51e238f7409ef9ab2cb3.poster.avif?t=1755547807\" width=616 height=110 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711090/extras/26eab541219b51e238f7409ef9ab2cb3.webm?t=1755547807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711090/extras/26eab541219b51e238f7409ef9ab2cb3.mp4?t=1755547807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The local townsfolk of <strong>KIFFTOWN</strong> are ready and waiting to exchange ridiculous banter with Bru, or give him a restraining order for <i>VERBAL HARASSMENT</i>. Blurt out <strong>non sequiturs</strong> if you're feeling <i>saucy</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711090/extras/493b62158e46323baadb8f05b74ade0b.poster.avif?t=1755547807\" width=616 height=112 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711090/extras/493b62158e46323baadb8f05b74ade0b.webm?t=1755547807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711090/extras/493b62158e46323baadb8f05b74ade0b.mp4?t=1755547807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Appease the hoarder inside us all! <strong>Collect the stickers</strong> littered around the world to unlock a SUPER SECRET SURPRISE.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You can't die!</strong> Low stress, max lols.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short game -\u00a0</strong>About 45 mins to complete.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mini-Game!</strong>\u00a0Stop the intrusive thoughts from infiltrating your mind in <i>Meditation HERO</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the thrilling first standalone episode in an upcoming trilogy of <i>Bru &amp; Boegie</i> games.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What the People are Saying</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;I have never played a game this funny...&quot; -\u00a0<i>Krizezivota</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;BRILLIANT. Loved every single thing about it.&quot; -\u00a0<i>latetothegames</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Full animation, big fan, a lotta lotta money went into this game - incredible. Epic cutscenes, 10/10 voice acting.&quot; - <i>GrayStillPlays</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;That was officially one of the strangest games I think I've ever played in my life.&quot; -\u00a0<i>GrayStillPlays</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;I honestly f*cking loved every minute of this! So witty and clever, all the little comments about the state of the world as well, just brilliant. Great little character and characters, and the voice acting was on par too! I really hope we get more episodes, like, Get Da Sugaaaa!&quot; -\u00a0<i>VonWeavey</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cAbsolute masterpiece.\u201d - <i>Alene</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;i just finished the game, i just love it, i think this is my new favorite game, or one of them...&quot; -\u00a0<i>dunkkke</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Amazing and unhinged game, I loved it\u201d -\u00a0<i>hyprZona</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cI LOVE THIS\u201d -\u00a0<i>Jaelix</i></p></li></ul>",
